# expect: there is no element whose `:hover` is an element
#
# A prefixed style argument becomes a rule of its own in the folded
# stylesheet, and `style.setProperty` sets declarations on elements: there
# is no element that is a `:hover` and none that is a media query. Emitting
# a rule at run time would mean a stylesheet the program writes into at run
# time, which is the injection surface the value grammars close.
state tone is client Text starting "red"

view
    Column
        Text "x", hoverColor is tone
